    "author_association": "NONE",
    "body": "### Problem\n\nMulticursor doesn't support Visual-Select.\nI'm not sure if this is a bug or a missing feature, but the current behavior seems inconsistent.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nWith 2 or more multucursors active, enter visual mode and press `<C-g>`.\n\nOnly the primary cursor switches to Select mode.\nThe other cursors appear to exit Visual mode instead.\n\n### Expected behavior\n\nVisual-Select should work as without multicursors.\n\n### Nvim version (nvim -v)\n\nNVIM v0.13.0-dev-1644+gaed60b8a53\n\n### Vim (not Nvim) behaves the same?\n\nnot applicable\n\n### Operating system/version\n\nWSL\n\n### Terminal name/version\n\nany\n\n### $TERM environment variable\n\nurelated\n\n### Installation\n\nfrom repo",
